---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Todd Margolis" description="Materializing the Invisible">

    <section class="mt-16 md:mt-24">
        <header class="text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto">
            <h1 class="font-serif text-5xl md:text-7xl text-white">Todd Margolis</h1>
            <p class="font-mono text-xs text-gray-400 mt-2">Materializing the Invisible.</p>
            <p class="text-lg text-gray-300 mt-6">A convergence of Creative Practice, Technical Inquiry, and Innovation Strategy.</p>
        </header>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-24">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 md:gap-12">
            <!-- Pillar 1: Creative -->
            <div class="border border-gray-800 p-8 rounded-lg flex flex-col">
                <h3 class="font-mono text-sm uppercase text-white">Creative</h3>
                <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-white mt-4">Artifacts of Stability</h2>
                <p class="font-mono text-xs text-gray-400 mt-2">Tangible Informatics</p>
                <p class="text-gray-400 mt-4 flex-grow">Materializing the invisible. Creating mechanical apparatuses, archival prints, and immersive installations that translate vast, abstract datasets into tangible experiences.</p>
                <ul class="mt-6 space-y-2">
                    <li><a href="#" class="font-mono text-sm text-white hover:text-glow transition-all">Immersive Installations</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#" class="font-mono text-sm text-white hover:text-glow transition-all">Tangible Artifacts</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#" class="font-mono text-sm text-white hover:text-glow transition-all">Augmented Interventions</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#" class="font-mono text-sm text-white hover:text-glow transition-all">Performative Systems</a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <!-- Pillar 2: Inquiry -->
            <div class="border border-gray-800 p-8 rounded-lg flex flex-col">
                <h3 class="font-mono text-sm uppercase text-white">Inquiry</h3>
                <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-white mt-4">Hybrid Ecosystems</h2>
                <p class="font-mono text-xs text-gray-400 mt-2">Synthesizing Human & Machine Perception</p>
                <p class="text-gray-400 mt-4 flex-grow">Investigating the "In-Betweens." Designing collaborative environments (Vroom), autostereoscopic systems (Varrier), and spatial interfaces where human intuition and computational logic operate in symbiosis.</p>
                <ul class="mt-6 space-y-2">
                    <li><a href="#" class="font-mono text-sm text-white hover:text-glow transition-all">Display & Interaction Systems</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#" class="font-mono text-sm text-white hover:text-glow transition-all">Collaborative Environments</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#" class="font-mono text-sm text-white hover:text-glow transition-all">Publications & Theory</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#" class="font-mono text-sm text-white hover:text-glow transition-all">Pedagogy & Labs</a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <!-- Pillar 3: Strategy -->
            <div class="border border-gray-800 p-8 rounded-lg flex flex-col">
                <h3 class="font-mono text-sm uppercase text-white">Strategy</h3>
                <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-white mt-4">Innovation Architecture</h2>
                <p class="font-mono text-xs text-gray-400 mt-2">Strategic Foresight & R&D Infrastructure</p>
                <p class="text-gray-400 mt-4 flex-grow">Architecting the future of R&D. Bridging the gap between "blue sky" academic invention and market-ready reality by designing the physical labs, cross-functional teams, and product roadmaps that make innovation scalable.</p>
                <ul class="mt-6 space-y-2">
                    <li><a href="#" class="font-mono text-sm text-white hover:text-glow transition-all">R&D Leadership</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#" class="font-mono text-sm text-white hover:text-glow transition-all">Institutional Architecture</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#" class="font-mono text-sm text-white hover:text-glow transition-all">Cultural Entrepreneurship</a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

</Layout>
